why Every Alliance quest of the City of Dalaran in one run, lead-in included.

# The City of Dalaran's Alliance quests in one guide: the pick-ups in
# Stormwind, Emissary Jacques in Hillsbrad Foothills, the Image of Archmage Modera by
# the lake, one run through the dungeon, then the hand-ins. Steps already done
# are passed over, so the guide picks up wherever the chain stands.
#
# The chain: Shylamiir's 92456 A Green Sample (a Fel Infused Blossom) and
# High Sorcerer Andromath's 92489 Power Overwhelming (the Mana Elemental) in
# Stormwind; Emissary Jacques' 92432 An Alarming Request -> Modera's 92457
# Starving Arcane (remnants and Mana Echoes) and 92458 Heart of Disruption
# (the Shade of the Archmage's Arcane Mote) -> 92459 Friend of the Kirin Tor
# (to Archmage Celindra).
#
# Left out: nothing of the Alliance's.
#
# Inside: nothing in the data places the bosses or the Fel Plants inside, so
# their goals stand at the door (@8.5,59.2, Alterac Mountains, by the lake)
# with `group 5`. The bosses come in the order of a run of my own (as a Horde
# character). Every quest goal is counted by the quest log, so a group that
# takes them in another order still gets each step ticked.
#
# Sources (facts only):
# - Quests, NPCs, items, objects and rewards: Polestar's reference data
#   (data/forever, built from QuestieDB Forever 1.1.4) and Polestar 0.4.1.1's
#   Codex page for the dungeon. Power Overwhelming's text asks for the Mana
#   Elemental; its objective counts the Arcanic Enigma.
# - The door: players' recordings, as Polestar's Codex holds them
#   (data/codex/entrances.json).
# - What drops where: players' recordings (data/codex/recorded.json): the
#   Fel Infused Blossom from the Fel Plants.
# - A run of my own on 2026-11-12 (Horde, five players), which the Horde
#   guide's header describes: the order of the bosses, and the remnants and
#   Mana Echo met inside after the Fel Ancient.
# - The dungeon's size, levels and bosses: the client's group finder and
#   dungeon journal, as Polestar's Codex page holds them (five players, levels
#   28 to 35). An Alarming Request needs level 30, so the guide starts there.
# - Lint warns that the door is more than 50 yards from the data's spots for
#   the Saturated Remnants, the Mana Echoes and the Arcanic Enigma: the data
#   places them within Dalaran's walls on the Alterac map, while my run met
#   the remnants and the Mana Echoes inside the dungeon (it has no record of
#   the Arcanic Enigma). The goals stay at the door, where the group goes
#   in.
# - Players' recordings, as Polestar holds them (data/codex/journal-quests.json):
#   Archmage Celindra stands in Dalaran city, not in the dungeon.

