step Mana Elemental
  tip On my run Atrexis, Lyn the Ignored, the Arcane Anomaly and the Fel Ancient came first; the remnants and Mana Echoes were about after the Fel Ancient. Power Overwhelming asks for the Mana Elemental, and the quest log calls the kill the Arcanic Enigma.
  kill 246016 quest 92489.1 @8.5,59.2 group 5

step Shade of the Archmage
  tip The Unstable Sentinel came before him on my run. He drops the Arcane Mote.
  collect 251961 quest 92458.1 @8.5,59.2 group 5

